---
import { url } from '../lib/path';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About This Website Demo" description="A shareable website demonstration for Flock Built Performance. Quote requests are simulated in your browser and nothing is sent or booked." path="/demo/">
<section class="page-hero section"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={url("/")}>Home</a><span>/</span>About this demo</div><span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE DEMONSTRATION / CLIENT REVIEW</span><h1>A demo you can explore.</h1><p class="page-display">THE SHOP.<br/><span>THE ROAD.</span></p><p>This is a presentation of the proposed Flock Built Performance website, built from supplied business facts and real project photos. It is not the final business website.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={url("/")}>Explore the home page &#8599;</a><a class="button button--outline" href={url("/contact/?service=tow")}>Try a sample transport request &#8599;</a></div></section>
<section class="section prose"><h2>Try the journey.</h2><p>Scroll the home page to part the photo panels and reveal the hex lights. Open the glass menu, explore the Civic comparison by tapping the image or using the slider, and watch the badge come together on The crew page. Browse repair and towing services and open an estimate request. Service links preselect the request type; transport options show pickup and drop-off fields.</p><p>Use sample details. The form validates inputs, processes optional photos in your browser and creates a sample receipt. Nothing leaves the tab, reaches the shop, books a job or takes payment. The Presentation tools option demonstrates a failed request and retry.</p><h2>Content awaiting approval.</h2><p>Shop hours, unit number, registration details, service coverage, fees, the Civic story and final photo/brand approval remain explicit fill-ins. Prices and reviews are omitted. The layered badge is a study based on the supplied shop artwork and awaits final vector approval.</p><p>Business call/text, map and Instagram links use supplied contact details and open only if you choose them. This preview sends no automatic messages and includes no analytics or embedded social/map content.</p></section>
</Base>

